          "name": "Notify QA Wolf that an ephemeral environment has been terminated",
          "request": {
            "name": "Notify QA Wolf that an ephemeral environment has been terminated",
            "description": {
              "content": "Notify QA Wolf that an ephemeral environment has been terminated. Stops all runs targeting the environment and requests flow promotion to the static base environment. The environment will show as \"closed\" in QA Wolf.",
